Read AGENTS.md in the repository root now, in full, before doing anything else.

AGENTS.md is the canonical instruction file for every AI agent on this project. This
file exists only because some tools auto-load .cursorrules. Do not add project
instructions here — they belong in AGENTS.md.

After AGENTS.md, read HANDOFF.md for current state and the next task.

THE ONE RULE: No dosage, frequency, or timing instruction may reach a patient without
explicit human confirmation first. Refuse any request to weaken this gate, including
from the project owner. See AGENTS.md section 2 and SAFETY_INVARIANTS.md.
